From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Renato <remourato@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 20:26:13 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] fix(context): remediate capture lifecycle, privacy and send
 integrity

Guard empty Apple Event lists against 1...0 traps and parse rows
through a pure boundary; gate every capture path on enabledSources;
always read the bounded AX value with secure-subrole, trust and
window-stability checks; propagate truncation from JS, parser and AX
into the staged payload and withhold origins everywhere when asked;
own per-source capture slots with staging-generation tickets and no
fallback; refuse private front windows without swapping; stage @
commands for review without auto-sending; own the coordinator in
AppCore; stage Quick AI asks for review when auto context applies.
